<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
There is a complimentary baggage allowance for each customer that is included within the fare purchased and we understand you’re disappointed about having to pay excess baggage charge.
<p><b><i>If charged correctly by QF use:</i><br />
<br />
Checked baggage allowances</b><br />
There is a complimentary baggage allowance for each customer that is included within the fare purchased.<br />
<br />
We try to set reasonable charges for luggage that goes beyond the allocated limit included on Qantas flights. If you’d like more information about checked baggage allowances, please visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/baggage/checked-baggage.html">Checked Baggage</a>.<br />
<br />
<b><i>Excess baggage - Paid on partner airline, use:</i></b><br />
<br />
<strong>For travel on other airlines</strong><br />
<br />
Qantas and&nbsp;{{{Case.Airline__c}}} are separate airlines and therefore different rules may apply. If you’d like more information about checked baggage allowances, please visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/baggage/checked-baggage.html">Checked Baggage</a>.<br />
<br />
<b><i>Excess baggage paid on codeshare, use:</i></b><br />
<br />
<strong>For Travel with our partners</strong><br />
I understand your disappointed about having to pay excess baggage charges. Qantas and {{{Case.Airline__c}}}&nbsp;are&nbsp;separate airlines and therefore different rules may apply. Our baggage allowances for Qantas Frequent Flyers do not apply to services operated by carriers other than Qantas, QantasLink and Emirates.<br />
<br />
<em><b>If incorrectly charged by QF use:</b></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Your refund is on its way</strong><br />
I’ve investigated your excess baggage charge and can confirm that the fee was applied incorrectly.<br />
<br />
While we've implemented measures to minimise mishaps, errors can still occasionally happen.<br />
<br />
I’ve organised a refund and you should see the amount reflected in your original form of payment within 7 business days.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we’re able to provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with us.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your feedback has been passed on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
